    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31.1a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 31.1a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hi ðone laford teon, þæt he be his rǽde ut leope, ladige hine mid fif ðegnum ⁊ beo him sylf syxta.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the lord is accused of advising him to escape, he shall clear himself with [the help of] five thegns, himself making a sixth.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf man þone hlaford teo, þæt he be his ræde ut hleope, ladige hine mid V þegnum ⁊ beo him sylf syxta.</ab>
      </div>
